# pass S1+S2: three program headers - the code LOAD = now
# READ+EXECUTE (never writable: nothing may patch live code),
# the globals LOAD = READ+WRITE at a page boundary (globals,
# static blocks, arena slack), and PT_GNU_STACK READ|WRITE keeps
# the stack non-executable. header_size = ehdr + 3 phdrs.
